# FSL agent skills. mise links them from the fslc version in mise.toml
# (skills.auto_sync, or `mise skills sync`). Each link points into the mise
# install directory of one machine, so do not commit them. mise makes
# .claude/skills as a symlink to .agents/skills, so it has no trailing /.
.agents/skills/
.claude/skills
